#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"<strong>Consent:</strong> for optional communications, cookies or other "
"processing where consent is required. You may withdraw consent at any time."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Consentement :</strong> pour les communications facultatives, "
"cookies ou traitements nécessitant un consentement. Vous pouvez le retirer à"
" tout moment."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"<strong>Contract:</strong> to take requested steps or provide services under"
" an agreement."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Contrat :</strong> pour prendre les mesures demandées ou fournir les"
" services d’un accord."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"<strong>Hong Kong:</strong> individuals have rights of access and correction"
" under the Personal Data (Privacy) Ordinance. Other rights may apply based "
"on the law governing the relevant processing."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Hong Kong :</strong> les personnes ont des droits d’accès et de "
"rectification en vertu de l’ordonnance sur les données personnelles "
"(confidentialité). D’autres droits peuvent s’appliquer selon la loi "
"régissant le traitement."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"<strong>Legal obligation:</strong> to meet applicable accounting, tax, "
"compliance, regulatory or law-enforcement duties."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Obligation légale :</strong> pour respecter les obligations "
"comptables, fiscales, réglementaires ou judiciaires applicables."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"<strong>Legitimate interests:</strong> to operate a secure B2B partner "
"platform, manage relationships, improve services and protect our business, "
"balanced against your rights."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Intérêts légitimes :</strong> pour exploiter une plateforme B2B "
"sûre, gérer les relations, améliorer les services et protéger notre "
"activité, en tenant compte de vos droits."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"Account and support information, such as login identifier, password stored "
"in protected form, verification status, enquiries and support records."
msgstr ""
"Informations de compte et d’assistance : identifiant, mot de passe stocké "
"sous forme protégée, statut de vérification, demandes et dossiers "
"d’assistance."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_terms
msgid ""
"Approval to use the Hub does not by itself appoint you as a distributor, "
"agent, representative, franchisee or exclusive partner, and does not create "
"a partnership, joint venture, fiduciary or employment relationship. Any such"
" relationship must be set out in a separate written agreement signed by "
"authorised representatives."
msgstr ""
"L’approbation d’accès ne vous désigne pas à elle seule distributeur, agent, "
"représentant, franchisé ou partenaire exclusif et ne crée ni société, "
"coentreprise, relation fiduciaire ni emploi. Une telle relation doit faire "
"l’objet d’un accord écrit distinct signé par des représentants habilités."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"Because we work with partners and service providers internationally, "
"personal data may be accessed or processed outside your country or region. "
"Privacy laws in those locations may differ."
msgstr ""
"Nous travaillons avec des partenaires et prestataires internationaux ; les "
"données peuvent donc être consultées ou traitées hors de votre pays ou "
"région. Les lois locales peuvent différer."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_terms
msgid ""
"Before starting formal proceedings, each party should first attempt in good "
"faith to resolve the dispute through written notice and reasonable business "
"discussions."
msgstr ""
"Avant toute procédure formelle, chaque partie doit tenter de bonne foi de "
"régler le litige par notification écrite et discussions commerciales "
"raisonnables."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"Business contact details, such as work email, company telephone, mobile or "
"WhatsApp number, country or region and company website."
msgstr ""
"Coordonnées professionnelles : e-mail, téléphone de l’entreprise, mobile ou "
"WhatsApp, pays ou région et site web."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_terms
msgid ""
"By creating an account, clicking to accept these Terms, or using the Hub, "
"you confirm that you have read and agree to these Terms and our"
msgstr ""
"En créant un compte, en acceptant ces conditions ou en utilisant le portail,"
" vous confirmez avoir lu et accepté ces conditions et notre"

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"Depending on applicable law, you may have the right to request access to "
"personal data, correction of inaccurate data, deletion, restriction or "
"objection to processing, withdrawal of consent, or a portable copy. You may "
"also have the right to complain to a competent privacy regulator."
msgstr ""
"Selon la loi applicable, vous pouvez demander l’accès, la rectification, "
"l’effacement, la limitation ou l’opposition au traitement, retirer votre "
"consentement ou obtenir une copie portable. Vous pouvez aussi saisir "
"l’autorité de protection des données compétente."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"Depending on your location and the activity, we may rely on one or more of "
"the following legal bases:"
msgstr ""
"Selon votre localisation et l’activité, nous pouvons nous appuyer sur une ou"
" plusieurs des bases juridiques suivantes :"

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_terms
msgid "Do not share an individual account or allow unauthorised access."
msgstr ""
"Ne partagez pas un compte individuel et n’autorisez pas d’accès non "
"autorisé."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"Identity and professional details, such as full name, job title and "
"employer."
msgstr ""
"Informations d’identité et professionnelles : nom complet, fonction et "
"employeur."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"If we use optional analytics, preference or marketing technologies, we will "
"identify them and provide consent choices where required. You can also "
"manage cookies through browser settings, although blocking necessary cookies"
" may prevent parts of the Hub from working."
msgstr ""
"Si nous utilisons des technologies facultatives d’analyse, de préférences ou"
" de marketing, nous les identifierons et proposerons les choix de "
"consentement requis. Vous pouvez gérer les cookies dans votre navigateur, "
"mais bloquer les cookies nécessaires peut empêcher certaines fonctions."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_terms
msgid ""
"If you submit feedback, you grant us a worldwide, royalty-free right to use "
"it to improve our products and services, without identifying you publicly "
"unless agreed."
msgstr ""
"En envoyant des commentaires, vous nous accordez un droit mondial gratuit de"
" les utiliser pour améliorer nos produits et services, sans vous identifier "
"publiquement sauf accord."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
msgid ""
"It applies to business contacts, applicants, approved partners, website "
"visitors and other individuals whose personal data we process through the "
"Hub. It does not govern third-party websites or services with their own "
"privacy notices."
msgstr ""
"Elle s’applique aux contacts professionnels, candidats, partenaires "
"approuvés, visiteurs et autres personnes dont nous traitons les données via "
"le portail. Elle ne régit pas les sites ou services tiers ayant leurs "
"propres notices."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_terms
msgid "Keep your password and authentication credentials confidential."
msgstr ""
"Gardez confidentiels votre mot de passe et vos identifiants "
"d’authentification."

#. module: b2b_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:b2b_website.partner_privacy
