"obligations are governed by the applicable quotation, order confirmation, "
"sales contract, warranty terms or other written agreement. If there is a "
"conflict, the specifically agreed commercial document prevails for that "
"transaction."
msgstr ""
"Commandes, devis, paiements, livraisons, garanties, retours et obligations "
